## Daily update (what-changed)
At the start of a session, read `uptodate/runs.log`. If it has no line that starts with today's date and contains `scope=all`,
tell the user in one line that today's update has not run and offer to run it
("Use the what-changed skill: run all due topics in light mode"). Do not run it without a yes,
and do not mention it again in the same day once offered.
